safha "Asaan Lang — آسان لینگ"
wasf "Pakistan ki Urdu/Roman-Urdu programming language. Developer Muaaz Iqbal, Mizanora."
lekhak "Muaaz Iqbal"
link_web "https://asaan-lang.vercel.app/"
peeche "#07140f"
accent "#3dd68c"

badge "v1.0  ·  پاکستان کی زبان"
unwan "آسان لینگ"
para "Pakistan ki apni programming language. English ki deewar khatam — soch Urdu mein, code Urdu mein, website bhi isi zubaan se."

card "آسان", "Bachay 10 minute mein pehla program chala lete hain. likho, lo, agar, bas — itna hi kaafi hai."
card "دو رسم الخط", "Roman-Urdu aur khalis Urdu script dono chalte hain. لکھو اور likho ek hi baat hai."
card "ویب بھی", "safha, unwan, card, button — isi language se asl website nikal aati hai."

unwan2 "Code aisa dikhta hai"
code_dikhao """naam = lo "Aap ka naam? "
agar naam != "" to
    likho "Khush Amdeed, " + naam + "!"
warna
    likho "Mehman, salaam!"
bas"""

unwan2 "Kyun Asaan Lang?"
para "Python seekhne se pehle aksar English seekhni padti hai. Asaan Lang pehle SOCH seekhati hai — variables, loops, decisions. Jab dimagh ready ho, Python aur JavaScript asaan lagte hain."

para "Yeh page khud Asaan Lang ke compiler ne banaya hai. Matlab language ab sirf 'hello world' nahi — is se asl cheezein ban sakti hain."

button "Playground Kholo", "/#studio"
button "School wali site dekho", "/school"

